{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONCEPT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancestral Players is a PvP FPS revisiting the  Arena Shooter experience\u00a0by including <strong>a leveling system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each death allows players to level up</strong> and enhance their abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This approach helps reduce skill disparities, offering a smoother experience for newcomers while\u00a0pushing experienced players further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGING WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/82322cba1a62d9bfe0e031b841f4a0ab.poster.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/82322cba1a62d9bfe0e031b841f4a0ab.webm?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/82322cba1a62d9bfe0e031b841f4a0ab.mp4?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose the Axe, the Bow, or the Coconut launcher, your <strong>aiming skill</strong> will be put to the test at every encounter. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO HEROES, JUST BOB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/0a746f8b0f36864288b0696bcac19bbb.poster.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/0a746f8b0f36864288b0696bcac19bbb.webm?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/0a746f8b0f36864288b0696bcac19bbb.mp4?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ancestral Players, everyone starts on equal footing, equipped with nothing but a dagger and a brief. Depending on the game mode, you will level up by either:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >following a pre-established progression path (inspired by 'gun game' game modes)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/0dd9fb9bfbdd98abe13ba6bec14f1ef4.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >picking upgrades yourself in the skill tree game mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/6298a763c79652a62a271c389f1e4b29.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/e172d02243df97331240f1efdfa31177.poster.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/e172d02243df97331240f1efdfa31177.webm?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/e172d02243df97331240f1efdfa31177.mp4?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players aren\u2019t the only danger in the arena, stay alert to the shifting environment. Master your movements to escape hazardous situations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN THE ALPHA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/6fa28bd0e3039608b75f852c99cbf77f.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the community\u00a0on discord and I'll give you a playtest key asap :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots are available for training while you wait for the next playtest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in active development and feedback is very welcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2349430?t=1761745654","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761745654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/1ab9b87dbd79e6728c0c243dea799262da958a1f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761745654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/1ab9b87dbd79e6728c0c243dea799262da958a1f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761745654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/6fa28bd0e3039608b75f852c99cbf77f.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=200 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the community\u00a0on discord! (link to the right)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONCEPT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancestral Players is a PvP FPS revisiting the  Arena Shooter experience\u00a0by including <strong>a leveling system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each death allows players to level up</strong> and enhance their abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This approach helps reduce skill disparities, offering a smoother experience for newcomers while\u00a0pushing experienced players further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGING WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/82322cba1a62d9bfe0e031b841f4a0ab.poster.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/82322cba1a62d9bfe0e031b841f4a0ab.webm?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/82322cba1a62d9bfe0e031b841f4a0ab.mp4?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose the Axe, the Bow, or the Coconut launcher, your <strong>aiming skill</strong> will be put to the test at every encounter. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO HEROES, JUST BOB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/0a746f8b0f36864288b0696bcac19bbb.poster.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/0a746f8b0f36864288b0696bcac19bbb.webm?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/0a746f8b0f36864288b0696bcac19bbb.mp4?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ancestral Players, everyone starts on equal footing, equipped with nothing but a dagger and a brief. Depending on the game mode, you will level up by either:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >following a pre-established progression path (inspired by 'gun game' game modes)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/0dd9fb9bfbdd98abe13ba6bec14f1ef4.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >picking upgrades yourself in the skill tree game mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/6298a763c79652a62a271c389f1e4b29.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/e172d02243df97331240f1efdfa31177.poster.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/e172d02243df97331240f1efdfa31177.webm?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/e172d02243df97331240f1efdfa31177.mp4?t=1761745654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players aren\u2019t the only danger in the arena, stay alert to the shifting environment. Master your movements to escape hazardous situations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN THE ALPHA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/6fa28bd0e3039608b75f852c99cbf77f.avif?t=1761745654\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the community\u00a0on discord and I'll give you a playtest key asap :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots are available for training while you wait for the next playtest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in active development and feedback is very welcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ENSLIP"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/e96eb14c8c7f8a2d14ef0d3b64d70413a9b7e869/header.jpg?t=1761745654","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2349430/248848877/e740ba9b797925174b80a5ae97e1551313a4d163/1761743279/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761745652","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2349430/248848877/e740ba9b797925174b80a5ae97e1551313a4d163/1761743279/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761745652","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2349430/248848877/e740ba9b797